1. uni2ts / Moirai
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Copyright (c) 2024, Salesforce, Inc.
    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
    Upstream: https://github.com/SalesforceAIResearch/uni2ts

The `amets/` package is derived from uni2ts (the codebase for the Moirai
time series foundation model). 57 of its 67 Python source files retain the
original Salesforce copyright header, and are either unmodified or modified from
their original form. Substantially derived components include the data pipeline
(`amets/data/`), transforms (`amets/transform/`), transformer and attention
modules (`amets/module/`), and the environment and optimizer helpers
(`amets/common/`, `amets/optim/`). `scripts/download_lotsa.py` also retains the
Salesforce header.

Modifications made for this project include, but are not limited to: the
structure-aware routing mechanism (`amets/model/combined_regime_predictor.py`, `amets/module/ffn_moe.py`), the
Mixture-of-Experts transformer variants (`amets/module/transformer_moe.py`),
point-prediction output in place of distributional output, and the associated
training and evaluation scripts.

