3. GIFT-Eval
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Copyright (c) 2024 Salesforce, Inc.
    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
    Upstream: https://github.com/SalesforceAIResearch/gift-eval

Evaluation imports the `gift_eval` package from a separate checkout that the
user obtains directly from upstream (see README). Two files adapt the windowing
logic of `gift_eval/data.py` and say so in their headers:
`amets/data/gift_eval_split.py` and `amets/data/gift_eval_val.py`. No other
GIFT-Eval code is included.

